{"title":"Arthas 生产排查 SOP","date":"2026-09-16T11:46:59.000Z","date_formatted":{"ll":"2026年9月16日","L":"2026/09/16","MM-DD":"09-16"},"author":"pairs","link":"2026/09/16/Arthas_sop","tags":["Java","排查"],"categories":["dev"],"updated":"2026-10-19T09:00:43.996Z","content":"<h1 id=\"arthas-生产排查-sop（标准流程-+-命令模板）\">Arthas 生产排查 SOP（标准流程 + 命令模板）<a title=\"#arthas-生产排查-sop（标准流程-+-命令模板）\" href=\"#arthas-生产排查-sop（标准流程-+-命令模板）\"></a></h1>\n<h2 id=\"1.-目的\">1. 目的<a title=\"#1.-目的\" href=\"#1.-目的\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>快速定位生产环境慢接口、耗时方法</li>\n<li>分析 SQL、RPC、代码逻辑耗时</li>\n<li>安全、可控地进行线上 Java 服务诊断</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"2.-arthas-部署\">2. Arthas 部署<a title=\"#2.-arthas-部署\" href=\"#2.-arthas-部署\"></a></h1>\n<h2 id=\"2.1-启动\">2.1 启动<a title=\"#2.1-启动\" href=\"#2.1-启动\"></a></h2>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">java -jar arthas-boot.jar</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>选择目标 JVM 进程进行 attach。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"2.2-离线部署\">2.2 离线部署<a title=\"#2.2-离线部署\" href=\"#2.2-离线部署\"></a></h2>\n<p>生产环境建议使用完整包：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">arthas-bin.zip</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>解压：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">arthas/</span><br><span class=\"line\">├── arthas-boot.jar</span><br><span class=\"line\">├── arthas-agent.jar</span><br><span class=\"line\">├── arthas-spy.jar</span><br><span class=\"line\">└── as.sh</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>启动：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">./as.sh</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>避免运行时联网下载依赖。</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"3.-慢接口排查流程\">3. 慢接口排查流程<a title=\"#3.-慢接口排查流程\" href=\"#3.-慢接口排查流程\"></a></h1>\n<h2 id=\"step-1：查看方法签名\">Step 1：查看方法签名<a title=\"#step-1：查看方法签名\" href=\"#step-1：查看方法签名\"></a></h2>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">sm com.example.Controller</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>确认方法参数。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"step-2：查看源码\">Step 2：查看源码<a title=\"#step-2：查看源码\" href=\"#step-2：查看源码\"></a></h2>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">jad com.example.Controller</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>定位：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Controller 调用了哪个 Service</li>\n<li>是否存在循环、远程调用、数据库查询</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"step-3：trace-调用链\">Step 3：trace 调用链<a title=\"#step-3：trace-调用链\" href=\"#step-3：trace-调用链\"></a></h2>\n<p>Controller：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">trace com.example.Controller methodName</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>Service：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">trace com.example.Service methodName</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>MyBatis：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">trace org.apache.ibatis.executor.BaseExecutor query</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>作用：</p>\n<p>定位具体耗时方法。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"step-4：watch-查看参数和耗时\">Step 4：watch 查看参数和耗时<a title=\"#step-4：watch-查看参数和耗时\" href=\"#step-4：watch-查看参数和耗时\"></a></h2>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">watch com.example.Controller methodName <span class=\"string\">&#x27;&#123;params,returnObj&#125;&#x27;</span> <span class=\"string\">&#x27;#cost&#x27;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>查看：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>方法参数</li>\n<li>返回结果</li>\n<li>执行耗时</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"step-5：tt-调用快照\">Step 5：tt 调用快照<a title=\"#step-5：tt-调用快照\" href=\"#step-5：tt-调用快照\"></a></h2>\n<p>开启：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">tt -t com.example.Controller methodName</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>查看：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">tt -l</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>查看详情：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">tt -i &lt;index&gt;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>手动清空快照：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">tt --delete-all</span><br><span class=\"line\">tt -d -i &lt;index&gt;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>注意：</p>\n<p>tt 不是：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">tt 类 方法 参数类型</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>这种写法。</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"4.-cpu-/-gc-排查\">4. CPU / GC 排查<a title=\"#4.-cpu-/-gc-排查\" href=\"#4.-cpu-/-gc-排查\"></a></h1>\n<h2 id=\"cpu-高\">CPU 高<a title=\"#cpu-高\" href=\"#cpu-高\"></a></h2>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">thread -n 10</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>查看热点线程。</p>\n<p>查看阻塞线程：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">thread -b</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"gc\">GC<a title=\"#gc\" href=\"#gc\"></a></h2>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">jstat -gc &lt;PID&gt; 1000</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"5.-arthas-生命周期管理（重要）\">5. Arthas 生命周期管理（重要）<a title=\"#5.-arthas-生命周期管理（重要）\" href=\"#5.-arthas-生命周期管理（重要）\"></a></h1>\n<h2 id=\"5.1-停止当前-trace/watch\">5.1 停止当前 trace/watch<a title=\"#5.1-停止当前-trace/watch\" href=\"#5.1-停止当前-trace/watch\"></a></h2>\n<p>执行：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">Ctrl + C</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>作用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>停止当前分析命令</li>\n<li>不关闭 Arthas</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"5.2-退出-arthas-客户端\">5.2 退出 Arthas 客户端<a title=\"#5.2-退出-arthas-客户端\" href=\"#5.2-退出-arthas-客户端\"></a></h2>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">quit</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>或者：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">exit</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>作用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>退出当前控制台</li>\n<li>不一定释放目标 JVM 中的 Arthas Server</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"5.3-完全关闭-arthas\">5.3 完全关闭 Arthas<a title=\"#5.3-完全关闭-arthas\" href=\"#5.3-完全关闭-arthas\"></a></h2>\n<p>排查结束后重新连接目标 JVM：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">java -jar arthas-boot.jar</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>进入 Arthas 后执行：(版本不同命令可能不同)</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">stop/shutdown</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>作用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>关闭 Arthas Server</li>\n<li>卸载 Arthas</li>\n<li>释放 Arthas 占用端口</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"5.4-端口冲突处理\">5.4 端口冲突处理<a title=\"#5.4-端口冲突处理\" href=\"#5.4-端口冲突处理\"></a></h2>\n<p>如果出现：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">Address already in use</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>通常原因：</p>\n<p>之前 Arthas 没有关闭。</p>\n<p>处理：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>重新 attach 原 Java 进程：</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">java -jar arthas-boot.jar</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<ol start=\"2\">\n<li>执行：(版本不同命令可能不同)</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">stop/shutdown</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<ol start=\"3\">\n<li>再重新启动 Arthas。</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"推荐结束流程\">推荐结束流程<a title=\"#推荐结束流程\" href=\"#推荐结束流程\"></a></h2>\n<p>排查完成：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">Ctrl+C</span><br><span class=\"line\">    ↓</span><br><span class=\"line\">stop/shutdown</span><br><span class=\"line\">    ↓</span><br><span class=\"line\">退出服务器</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>不要只执行：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">quit</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>否则可能留下 Arthas Server，占用端口。</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"6.-arthas-tunnel-server\">6. Arthas Tunnel Server<a title=\"#6.-arthas-tunnel-server\" href=\"#6.-arthas-tunnel-server\"></a></h1>\n<p>用于远程诊断：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">本地 Arthas</span><br><span class=\"line\">      |</span><br><span class=\"line\">      |</span><br><span class=\"line\">Tunnel Server</span><br><span class=\"line\">      |</span><br><span class=\"line\">      |</span><br><span class=\"line\">生产 JVM</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>适合：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>内网服务器</li>\n<li>无法直接访问 JVM</li>\n<li>多机器管理</li>\n</ul>\n<p>启动：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">java -jar arthas-tunnel-server.jar</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"7.-常用命令汇总\">7. 常用命令汇总<a title=\"#7.-常用命令汇总\" href=\"#7.-常用命令汇总\"></a></h1>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 查看方法</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">sm com.example.Controller</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 查看源码</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">jad com.example.Controller</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 调用链耗时</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">trace com.example.Controller methodName</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 查看参数和耗时</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">watch com.example.Controller methodName <span class=\"string\">&#x27;&#123;params,returnObj&#125;&#x27;</span> <span class=\"string\">&#x27;#cost&#x27;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 调用记录</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">tt -t com.example.Controller methodName</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 停止当前命令</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">Ctrl+C</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 关闭 Arthas</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">shutdown/stop</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 退出客户端</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">quit</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"8.-排查口诀\">8. 排查口诀<a title=\"#8.-排查口诀\" href=\"#8.-排查口诀\"></a></h1>\n<p>先 jad 看源码</p>\n<p>↓</p>\n<p>trace 找耗时</p>\n<p>↓</p>\n<p>watch 看参数</p>\n<p>↓</p>\n<p>tt 做快照</p>\n<p>↓</p>\n<p>stop/shutdown清理 Arthas</p>\n","prev":{"title":"Git 学习笔记","link":"2026/11/25/Git学习笔记"},"next":{"title":"JVM 虚拟机","link":"2026/08/13/JVM虚拟机"},"plink":"https://pairs-vip.github.io/2026/09/16/Arthas_sop/","toc":[{"id":"arthas-生产排查-sop（标准流程-+-命令模板）","title":"Arthas 生产排查 SOP（标准流程 + 命令模板）","index":"1","children":[{"id":"1.-目的","title":"1. 目的","index":"1.1"}]},{"id":"2.-arthas-部署","title":"2. Arthas 部署","index":"2","children":[{"id":"2.1-启动","title":"2.1 启动","index":"2.1"},{"id":"2.2-离线部署","title":"2.2 离线部署","index":"2.2"}]},{"id":"3.-慢接口排查流程","title":"3. 慢接口排查流程","index":"3","children":[{"id":"step-1：查看方法签名","title":"Step 1：查看方法签名","index":"3.1"},{"id":"step-2：查看源码","title":"Step 2：查看源码","index":"3.2"},{"id":"step-3：trace-调用链","title":"Step 3：trace 调用链","index":"3.3"},{"id":"step-4：watch-查看参数和耗时","title":"Step 4：watch 查看参数和耗时","index":"3.4"},{"id":"step-5：tt-调用快照","title":"Step 5：tt 调用快照","index":"3.5"}]},{"id":"4.-cpu-/-gc-排查","title":"4. CPU &#x2F; GC 排查","index":"4","children":[{"id":"cpu-高","title":"CPU 高","index":"4.1"},{"id":"gc","title":"GC","index":"4.2"}]},{"id":"5.-arthas-生命周期管理（重要）","title":"5. Arthas 生命周期管理（重要）","index":"5","children":[{"id":"5.1-停止当前-trace/watch","title":"5.1 停止当前 trace&#x2F;watch","index":"5.1"},{"id":"5.2-退出-arthas-客户端","title":"5.2 退出 Arthas 客户端","index":"5.2"},{"id":"5.3-完全关闭-arthas","title":"5.3 完全关闭 Arthas","index":"5.3"},{"id":"5.4-端口冲突处理","title":"5.4 端口冲突处理","index":"5.4"},{"id":"推荐结束流程","title":"推荐结束流程","index":"5.5"}]},{"id":"6.-arthas-tunnel-server","title":"6. Arthas Tunnel Server","index":"6"},{"id":"7.-常用命令汇总","title":"7. 常用命令汇总","index":"7"},{"id":"8.-排查口诀","title":"8. 排查口诀","index":"8"}],"reading_time":"786 字约 5 分钟"}